+| `syscall.fstat` | syscall | 5 | partial | mediate | no | instance descriptor | `test-systemd` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.poll` | syscall | 7 | partial | mediate | no | bounded descriptor set | `test-systemd` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.lseek` | syscall | 8 | complete | mediate | no | instance descriptor | `test-systemd` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.mmap` | syscall | 9 | partial | mediate | no | W^X and bounded mapping | `test-runtime` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.mprotect` | syscall | 10 | partial | mediate | no | W^X | `test-runtime` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.munmap` | syscall | 11 | complete | mediate | no | managed mapping | `test-runtime` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.brk` | syscall | 12 | complete | mediate | no | managed address space | `test-runtime` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.rt_sigaction` | syscall | 13 | partial | mediate | no | virtual signal state | `test-process` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.rt_sigprocmask` | syscall | 14 | partial | mediate | no | virtual signal state | `test-process` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.rt_sigreturn` | syscall | 15 | partial | mediate | no | supervised frame | `test-process` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.ioctl` | syscall | 16 | partial | mediate | no | cataloged request families; no signal-driven I/O | `test-devices` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
+| `syscall.pread64` | syscall | 17 | partial | mediate | no | bounded instance descriptor | `test-native-vfs` | x86-64 Linux ABI only |
