+# Unified repository transition
+
+## Goal
+
+Make the userspace-kernel implementation the next Ginux development line while
+preserving the complete standalone bootable-kernel history as an immutable,
+discoverable historical line.
+
+## Approved scope
+
+- Preserve the final standalone-kernel `main` commit `4d4a53bb` as branch
+  `bootable-kernel` and annotated tag `bootable-kernel-final`.
+- Base `codex/userspace-transition` on the accepted staging-repository merge
+  commit `2306c2e`.
+- Join the standalone-kernel history as a second parent without replacing any
+  userspace-kernel source files.
+- Update project identity, repository links, transition documentation, and the
+  HDAE checkpoint for the unified repository.
+- Retain the existing Apache 2.0 `LICENSE` and project `NOTICE` on the active
+  development line.
+- Replace standalone EFI-kernel CI commands with userspace-kernel formatting,
+  lint, and unit-test validation. Keep full QEMU testing at HDAE gates rather
+  than every pull request.
+- Verify the userspace-kernel tree and its deterministic test suite before
+  publishing a pull request against `main`.
+
+## Non-goals
+
+- Merge or push directly to `main`.
+- Delete, rewrite, or archive either repository or either historical line.
+- Implement Gate 9 or change userspace-kernel behavior.
+- Import generated paper/PDF artifacts left untracked in the working tree.
+- Continue development of the standalone bootable kernel.
+
+## Completed work
+
+- [x] Verify both repositories have no open pull requests or issues.
+- [x] Verify Gate 8 and prerequisite rename changes are merged into the
+  staging repository at `2306c2e`.
+- [x] Create `codex/userspace-transition` from the verified userspace commit.
+- [x] Create local `bootable-kernel` and `bootable-kernel-final` refs at the
+  final standalone-kernel commit.
+- [x] Join both histories with the standalone kernel as a second parent.
+- [x] Update transition documentation and repository identity.
+- [x] Run source-drift, history, build, and complete regression verification.
+- [x] Publish the historical branch and annotated tag.
+- [x] Commit and publish the transition branch.
+- [x] Open pull request 152 against current Ginux `main`.
+
+## Remaining work
+
+- [x] Human review and acceptance of pull request 152.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- `bootable-kernel` and the peeled `bootable-kernel-final` tag resolve to
+  `4d4a53bb` locally and on `origin`.
+- The transition head descends from both `2306c2e` and `4d4a53bb`.
+- Application source matches accepted staging commit `2306c2e`; only approved
+  transition documentation, HDAE state, and legal metadata differ.
+- README and HDAE records describe Ginux as the active userspace kernel and
+  point to the preserved standalone-kernel branch and tag.
+- Pull-request CI runs the userspace-kernel static and unit checks without
+  invoking removed standalone EFI/QEMU targets.
