+- Proc performance and accounting regression -> time repeated `ps -ef` and
+  `top` samples in the managed shell, assert that proc refreshes are targeted
+  rather than complete-tree refreshes, and reject malformed or implausible
+  user/system timing fields while retaining live task visibility.
+- Attach lifecycle test -> start detached, attach, detach with byte `0x1d`,
